  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When typing in desktop mode, the keyboard UI is mostly unnecessary. However, it occupies a large portion of the screen, blocking the expressions and information of the person I'm communicating with, which is very stressful.\n\nIt would be beneficial to have an option to show or hide the key buttons, displaying only the input text box. Additionally, the ability to make the keyboard transparent would be advantageous for users on other platforms as well. Furthermore, if the position of the input text box could be freely adjusted, it would allow for uninterrupted communication while keeping the beautiful avatars in view.",
